id: pm-jev-replay-ambiguity
title: Refuse ambiguous native model aliases before replay pinning
description: Share admission native inventory resolution with replay and prove conflict refusal before inspection or inference in both inventory orders.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: admission,"gh:unbraind/pm-jev#100",replay
